; step_limit_zero_empty_program: zero steps is enough for a program that
; needs zero steps.
;
; The success half of the exact-limit rule that step_limit_zero pins the
; fault half of. The program has no instructions, so it ends at the end of
; the stream without dispatching anything. Reaching the end of the stream
; is not charged, so the run completes under a budget of exactly zero and
; reports zero steps.
